# Voyage Home's affinity counts the artifacts its caster controls, not the other player's (CR 702.41a). Bot1 has three Moxen
# - Pearl, Sapphire and Jet - so the spell costs {2}{W}{U}, four mana, and Bot1 has only three: the cast is refused, though
# Bot2's three Moxen would make it {W}{U} were they counted. A Sol Ring (cast with Mox Jet) is a fourth artifact: the cost falls to {1}{W}{U}, and Sol Ring, Mox Pearl and Mox Sapphire pay it.

